**Read:** [DC Electrical Circuit Analysis — James M. Fiore](../sources/DC-Electrical-Circuit-Analysis-Fiore.lingua#r_4A9FXBXKNPS4JV50QQ3TVPS2GV), the entire book and substantial exercises; [AC Electrical Circuit Analysis — James M. Fiore](../sources/AC-Electrical-Circuit-Analysis-Fiore.lingua#r_0C4FYP5P0A5GQP13HAD8FTEEWK), the entire book and appropriate laboratory companion; [Introduction to Electric Power Systems — MIT 6.061](../sources/Introduction-to-Electric-Power-Systems-MIT.lingua#r_6JR10ZVGMZ7GT4RRK7734JQ7WD), the complete available public course and notes.

Start with a useful service: light, controlled motion, pumping, computing or an industrial process. Follow energy from its source through conductors and equipment to the load, then ask what keeps the service within its operating conditions. Voltage, current, power, energy, insulation, protection and control answer different parts of that question.

Read the complete [DC Electrical Circuit Analysis — James M. Fiore](../sources/DC-Electrical-Circuit-Analysis-Fiore.lingua#r_4A9FXBXKNPS4JV50QQ3TVPS2GV) and [AC Electrical Circuit Analysis — James M. Fiore](../sources/AC-Electrical-Circuit-Analysis-Fiore.lingua#r_0C4FYP5P0A5GQP13HAD8FTEEWK) books, working substantial problems and appropriate isolated educational laboratory exercises. Continue through the entire available [Introduction to Electric Power Systems — MIT 6.061](../sources/Introduction-to-Electric-Power-Systems-MIT.lingua#r_6JR10ZVGMZ7GT4RRK7734JQ7WD) course and [Sistemas elétricos de potência — Arlei Bichels](../sources/Sistemas-Eletricos-de-Potencia-Bichels.lingua#r_5T4SVBJ6FAPQWJPVNQV4Y6427G) text. The introductory notes omit a converter chapter; [Power Electronics — MIT 6.334, Spring 2007](../sources/Power-Electronics-MIT-6-334.lingua#r_071M46GNC27PPJVTZEQTMEF526) supplies a complete distinct progression. Shared [Electromagnetism — charge, fields, matter, waves and physical evidence](../../../physics/electromagnetism/Electromagnetism.lingua#r_5TJPESCTTNAKY66JH2QNQYN1PY) Records provide the field explanations and explicit mathematical/measurement connections when needed.

The later spine includes all of [Electric Machines — MIT 6.685, Fall 2013](../sources/Electric-Machines-MIT-6-685.lingua#r_6A4HM4XV13NAZDRV92PZDJ31XH), the public [Power System Dynamics and Control — A. M. Kulkarni](../sources/Power-System-Dynamics-and-Control-Kulkarni.lingua#r_2T4WS3TCPCXRB5JEH7HTN5FAHQ), [Power System Protection — S. A. Soman, IIT Bombay](../sources/Power-System-Protection-Soman-NPTEL.lingua#r_52Z22QR7WGDJHAFBDMPFGYCXJE) and [Three-phase unbalanced networks — Biswarup Das](../sources/Three-Phase-Unbalanced-Networks-Das.lingua#r_4J5TZVPWY0FYP8WY7AGZM8NQ4B) programmes, full modelling/method manuals and whole primary research. [A full practical and graduate power-engineering programme](../study/A-full-practical-and-graduate-power-engineering-programme.lingua#r_762ATXJ9563BT8M3229MP1G1FR) describes the practical, design, graduate and independent scholarly depth. Read original methods before adopting their conclusions, reconstruct unfamiliar calculations and keep a notebook of assumptions, corrections and evidence. Practical competence requires suitable supervised physical experience; analysing a published plant or simulated network should be identified accurately as that kind of work.

**Continue:** [A load, a source and a continuing service](A-load-a-source-and-a-continuing-service.lingua#r_2N87DRV5NA20MK2HE1XEC7PF1X).

**Return:** [Electrical power engineering — sources, networks, machines and continuing service](../Electrical-power-engineering.lingua#r_300EPNGATK7PHWNZCQFBXGZFCQ).
